  {
   "day": 7,
   "line": "SYSTEM: Neural interface stable. Text overlay enabled."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "line": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "line": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 25,
   "line": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Kyle speaks at Emberhold's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "line": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "line": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Walt speaks at Stonebridge's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "line": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Walt speaks at Thornfield's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 27,
   "line": "💔 A faction of Emberhold has turned cannibal — and split. The eaters walked. The Red Table is a new fire in the world now — 3 people under Kenji."
  },
  {
   "day": 29,
   "line": "🧳 Emberhold has split — the eaters walked. They call the new fire The Red Table. Half of them were headed this way, or so the traveler says."
  },
  {
   "day": 30,
   "line": "Word later: they walked to The Red Table. Another fire in the world, whether you wanted it or not."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "line": "◈ FLASHBACK — Ingrid's Drawing\nKitchen table, burnt pancakes. You told her the sun needed holding, and she took you literally — drew you carrying it with both hands. She was six. The sky changed three weeks later."
  },
  {
   "day": 36,
   "line": "A runner from The Red Table, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 43,
   "line": "🧳 A traveler passed through yesterday, talking about a village to the southeast called The Red Table. The region is bigger than your fire."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "line": "🥣 Dmitri of The Red Table walks into your firelight alone, thinner than you remember. \"Our jars are empty,\" they say. No preamble. \"I'm asking for food.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "line": "Dmitri waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Red Table with nothing. They'll remember the silence."
  },
  {
   "day": 61,
   "line": "🌙 Raid — The Red Table came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
  },
