  },
  {
   "day": 84,
   "line": "◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from The Red Table bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Feared. The show's narration lingers on your hands."
  },
  {
   "day": 88,
   "line": "🌙 Night. Shouts from the treeline — Kenji of The Red Table with 2 others, and they're not here to talk. \"Your pantry or your blood. Choose.\" (They want ~2,000 kcal.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 88,
   "line": "🌙 Raid — The Red Table came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~1497 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"
